og_preferred_address, qlog_tp_version_negotiation, qlog_transport_extensions).\n   - **`picoquictest/quic_tester.c`** (345 lines) - `initial_ping_test` and `initial_ping_ack_test` using `tls_api_init_ctx_ex`, inject initial packets with ping/ack frames, call `tls_api_connection_loop`, `tls_api_test_with_loss_final`.\n   - **`picoquictest/sacktest.c`** (795 lines) - 6 tests: sacktest (basic record/query), sendacktest (ACK frame format), sendack_loop_test, ackrange_test, ack_disorder_test, ack_horizon_test.\n   - **`rs/fq/src/tests/parseheadertest.rs`** - Currently 4 `todo!()` stubs: `header_length`, `incoming_initial`, `packet_enc_dec`, `parseheader`.\n   - **`rs/fq/src/tests/sacktest.rs`** (763 lines) - ALREADY FULLY TRANSLATED. Complete bodies for all 6 tests, uses `PacketContext`, `SackList`, `Quic::new`, `create_connection`, `record_pn_received`, `is_ack_needed`, `format_ack_frame`, etc.\n   - **`rs/fq/src/tests/pn2pn64test.rs`** (249 lines) - ALREADY FULLY TRANSLATED. Uses `get_packet_number64` with 36-case known-answer table.\n   - **`rs/fq/src/tests/picolog.rs`** - 1 `todo!()` stub.\n   - **`rs/fq/src/tests/picoquic_lb.rs`** - 2 `todo!()` stubs.\n   - **`rs/fq/src/tests/qlog_frame.rs`** - 1 `todo!()` stub.\n   - **`rs/fq/src/tests/qlog.rs`** - 2 `todo!()` stubs.\n   - **`rs/fq/src/tests/quic_tester.rs`** - 2 `todo!()` stubs.\n   - **`rs/fq/src/lb.rs`** - `Config` struct (method, rotation_bits, first_byte_encodes_length, server_id_length, nonce_length, connection_id_length, server_id: u64, cid_encryption_key: [u8;16]), `ConnectionIdContext::generate/verify`, `Quic::set_lb_cid_config/clear_lb_cid_config`, `Config::parse` - all `todo!()`.\n   - **`rs/fq/src/internal.rs`** (partial reads) - Key structs:\n     - `PacketHeader` at line 320: dest_connection_id, src_connection_id, packet_number_truncated: u32, version: u32, offset, packet_number_offset, packet_type, packet_number_mask: u64, packet_number_full: u64, payload_length, version_index: i32, epoch, packet_con